<title>UK: BayerVB sets 200 bln lire 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 200 bln lire 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banca Nazionale del Lavoro, Bayerische Vereinsbank and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON     6.80	MATURITY    03.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.305   PAY DATE    03.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
